<title>USA: Alcan hikes U.S. aluminum price by 5 cents.</title>
<headline>Alcan hikes U.S. aluminum price by 5 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Ltd said its December ingot and billet list prices in the U.S. were raised five cents to 75 and 85 cents alb, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodities 212-859-1646</p>
</text>
